                    "json": "## Selection summary\n\nYou are investigating requests to URL *{RequestUri}* that matched WAF rules.\n\nSelected request: transaction ID *{TransactionId}*.\n\nSelected rule match:\n- Message: {message}\n- Details: {details}\n- Matched data: {matcheddata}"
                  },
                  "name": "text - 7 - Copy"
